Source code and licences for pocket-ui for Android @VERSION@
==========================================================

pocket-ui for Android is free software (GPL version 2 or later; LICENSE and NOTICE.md in this app's licences list
what is not ours). Its emulator cores are separate programs with their own free licences (GPL, LGPL, MPL, AGPL and
permissive ones). You may have the complete source code of all of them, exactly as built into this app.


Where it is
-----------

Next to the APK, on @RELEASE_URL@ :

  @ARCHIVE@
      For every core below: the complete corresponding source at the commit named, with the patches already applied
      and its embedded dependencies, as one archive per core (corresponding-source/), plus manifest.json (names and sha256).
      The patches are also in this archive's patches/ folder.
  pocket-ui-android-licences.txt
      This offer, pocket-ui's licence, NOTICE.md and the list of cores.

pocket-ui's own source is the public repository, at the commit of this release.

The licence texts are in the app as well: Settings -> Licences lists every core with its licence, upstream commit and
patches. The files are in the APK under assets/licences/ (also for the cores that are optional downloads), and each
downloaded core keeps its own licences/ folder next to its library.


