Written offer
-------------

For at least three years from the release of this app, anyone can get the complete corresponding source code of the
GPL-, LGPL-, MPL- and AGPL-licensed software in it, for no charge beyond the cost of providing it. To ask, open an issue
titled "Source request" at @ISSUES_URL@ and name this app: pocket-ui for Android @VERSION@.
This offer is valid for anyone who has this information.
